Lovely platformer/adventure game, beautiful & relaxing. Light puzzles and no talking does mean it's on the shorter side. No problem with gamepad or keyboard, controls cannot be remapped and desktop resolution is used. Great for unwinding after a long day!
Cheap game that isn't trash or an asset flip? Miracles never cease.
@Devs. Please consider adding a few steam achievements? :)

The game has finally be fixed, and i can play normally ! Yeah !
// I love the game but i have to downvote until it's fixed.
// I play this game since it's in early access, and during that time, everything was working well.
// Then after some update, i could simply play only one game, since the game began to stutter during the second game, becoming totally unplayable (about 1 frame per 10 secondes).
// Now, it is no more in early access, and it's even worse.
// I can't even play one normal game anymore, as the game suffers massive FPS drops (going from // 60 to 20 to 50 to 15 and so on), making it totally unplayable.
// It's not happening to everyone of course. So if you want to try your luck it's up to you, but be aware the fun can turn into a nightmare if you encounter the same issues

